{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/1dbb79fe3b1411c003dfc597bc3419c2.avif?t=1769806878\" width=600 height=149 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lost and Found Co.</strong> is a whimsical hidden object game where you help Ducky, a duck-turned-human intern, at Goddess Mei\u2019s company - a magical startup dedicated to finding lost items for its quirky townspeople. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/a1679a19f6b91ae98cd53c6ee3571079.poster.avif?t=1769806878\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/a1679a19f6b91ae98cd53c6ee3571079.webm?t=1769806878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/a1679a19f6b91ae98cd53c6ee3571079.mp4?t=1769806878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/46f41060c406a2dccb3cda16b7b4d364.avif?t=1769806878\" width=600 height=118 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Go on an adventure!</strong> <br>Travel through charming locales that bring your childhood puzzle books to life in a heartwarming and whimsical world filled with bunch of items to discover! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find out the goings-on in this wholesome place!</strong> <br>Return lost items to their rightful owners in this adorable world, filled with thousands of interactive characters and objects-and we really mean thousands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunt for well-hidden items in engaging challenge levels!</strong> <br>Put your object-hunting skills to the test on these fun challenging levels, delivering pure hidden object gameplay goodness. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chock-full of content!</strong> <br>Enjoy countless levels with tons of items to find. <br>This lively, animated world offers a joyful escape for players of all ages. Endless fun awaits! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/df7e315cefb3b129396063aa5fda1dcf.avif?t=1769806878\" width=600 height=137 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player hidden object story campaign</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bonus challenge levels testing your keen eyes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of interactive levels taking you on a journey</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Decorate and customize your office</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover easter eggs, surprises, and secrets galore!!!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/4e666c2204ef29a2c04652b6ed416048.poster.avif?t=1769806878\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/4e666c2204ef29a2c04652b6ed416048.webm?t=1769806878\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2101390/extras/4e666c2204ef29a2c04652b6ed416048.mp4?t=1769806878\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101390?t=1769806878","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2101390?t=1769806